                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                        "entry_id": "cca71df1-895e-3e6c-91ab-2521326ee61f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вдоволь полюбоваться; в полной мере испытать удовлетворение, восхищение, созерцая кого-либо, что-либо, наблюдая за чьей-либо деятельностью, поступками, чертами характера и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b00391b-34d2-461d-9149-3d79cf891c7d",
                                "sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                                "text": "По выходе отца своего она долго еще принаряживалась и жеманилась перед небольшим в оловянных рамках зеркалом и не могла налюбоваться собою."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03e2271f-4738-4c4c-beb6-cf4748e81a42",
                        "source_entry_id": "cca71df1-895e-3e6c-91ab-2521326ee61f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                        "target_lang_word": "admire",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "admire",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d03f46c-4e60-3d65-982a-87c40328840d",
                                        "entry_id": "fa533d1a-cef7-32bb-afa1-e1e6d8a73a6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be amazed at; to view with surprise; to marvel at."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b41bb89-c8b6-4398-8dd1-a9ff220ce8ec",
                                                "sense_id": "4d03f46c-4e60-3d65-982a-87c40328840d",
                                                "text": "The poor fellow, admiring how he came there, was served in state all day long […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc689130-f446-42a9-8c07-417b4035f170",
                                                "sense_id": "4d03f46c-4e60-3d65-982a-87c40328840d",
                                                "text": "examples rather to be admired than imitated"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4e18805-5d9c-34f3-a615-ddd35472e7d0",
                                        "entry_id": "fa533d1a-cef7-32bb-afa1-e1e6d8a73a6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To regard with wonder and delight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "883522a5-b6cd-4cfa-92e5-36936209956d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e18805-5d9c-34f3-a615-ddd35472e7d0",
                                                "text": "kings ſhall crouch vnto our conquering ſwords,\nAnd hoſtes of Souldiers ſtand amazd at vs,\nWhen with their fearfull tongues they ſhall confeſſe\nTheſe are the men that al the world admires,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29510499-8d1c-3766-a241-517caaa8d9bf",
                                        "entry_id": "fa533d1a-cef7-32bb-afa1-e1e6d8a73a6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To look upon with an elevated feeling of pleasure, as something which calls out approbation, esteem, love or reverence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c6b9f9a-5f2d-34d4-90d5-553fc2d63ece",
                                        "entry_id": "fa533d1a-cef7-32bb-afa1-e1e6d8a73a6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To estimate or value highly; to hold in high esteem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c50c9588-0c50-4d76-b57d-d4a175985973",
                                                "sense_id": "2c6b9f9a-5f2d-34d4-90d5-553fc2d63ece",
                                                "text": "to admire a person of high moral worth"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85fb732b-44b9-4bf2-ad0a-61eec49a243d",
                                                "sense_id": "2c6b9f9a-5f2d-34d4-90d5-553fc2d63ece",
                                                "text": "to admire a landscape"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32f2b2a6-b9ca-4233-9bb7-4cc99e8894cd",
                                                "sense_id": "2c6b9f9a-5f2d-34d4-90d5-553fc2d63ece",
                                                "text": "He'd always been (very) much admired by his colleagues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "201fb680-8c69-487e-8cd4-e4e9b6b69b51",
                                                "sense_id": "2c6b9f9a-5f2d-34d4-90d5-553fc2d63ece",
                                                "text": "I'm so sick and tired of bein' admired. That I wish that I would just die or get fired."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "262bc474-e43b-373f-8005-da8788038b63",
                                        "entry_id": "fa533d1a-cef7-32bb-afa1-e1e6d8a73a6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be enthusiastic about (doing something); to want or like (to do something). (Sometimes followed by to.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b55af7e8-11b0-49c3-89c2-bfdde9facfcd",
                                                "sense_id": "262bc474-e43b-373f-8005-da8788038b63",
                                                "text": "I'm not sayin' she's touched the Devil, now, but I'd admire to know what books she reads and why she hides them — she'll not answer me, y' see."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b0d8038-1ba0-4acb-809a-bc00ff74a67e",
                                                "sense_id": "262bc474-e43b-373f-8005-da8788038b63",
                                                "text": "And I'd admire seeing this creek become a sort of stopping place for geese of one sort and another."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b5c0d3f-2938-4e3c-b3be-83abd689fbb7",
                                                "sense_id": "262bc474-e43b-373f-8005-da8788038b63",
                                                "text": "“I hope you do. I'd admire seeing a lot of you.” They made camp down at the creek. Will spread her blanket not too far from his. “Well, aren't you a lady's man.” “Why do you say that?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1047d317-1613-4ba7-9b66-88e512dbb458",
                        "source_entry_id": "cca71df1-895e-3e6c-91ab-2521326ee61f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                        "target_lang_word": "admirar",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "admirar",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8892dcc4-17bb-3a8d-8370-35948532542a",
                                        "entry_id": "41542237-2085-37b4-9d83-c235b8060338",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mirar con encanto."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aaee927-e206-3c35-8e8d-ea4ea6bbdd14",
                                        "entry_id": "41542237-2085-37b4-9d83-c235b8060338",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tener en muy alta consideración."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d31c6377-5377-39f5-af08-648a9ef0505e",
                                        "entry_id": "41542237-2085-37b4-9d83-c235b8060338",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causar sorpresa la vista o consideración de una cosa extraordinaria o inesperada."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74007f12-ce58-4d0e-a7f1-d6091b656370",
                                                "sense_id": "d31c6377-5377-39f5-af08-648a9ef0505e",
                                                "text": "La mujer, que es Isabela,\nque para admirarte nombro\nretirada en esa pieza,\ndice que es el duque Octavio\nquien, con engaño y cautela,\nla gozó."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16a6d7f7-87a3-4c55-99cf-cd43f515427f",
                                                "sense_id": "d31c6377-5377-39f5-af08-648a9ef0505e",
                                                "text": "Nada de esto me admira. Pues por voluntad divina, si yo entiendo algo de ello, le vinieron esos sufrimientos a la cruel Crisa."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78d0a8ab-d8a4-40fe-b6ad-ecb8c5ba6aef",
                        "source_entry_id": "cca71df1-895e-3e6c-91ab-2521326ee61f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                        "target_lang_word": "sich satt sehen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b70419cc-d410-4a32-8581-d9d69f042d83",
                        "source_entry_id": "cca71df1-895e-3e6c-91ab-2521326ee61f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2e7983-7c11-3d9d-b3a9-d4e1745d1621",
                        "target_lang_word": "admirer",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "admirer",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                        "entry_id": "a460da13-b8b6-32ea-8504-3ed4c3599108",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Considérer avec un étonnement mêlé de plaisir ce qui paraît beau, ce qui paraît merveilleux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af1f0622-8461-4ee5-a88f-e700872a5809",
                                                "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                                "text": "Aussi à Lima, tous les étrangers vont-ils à l’église, non pour entendre chanter aux moines l’office divin, mais pour admirer, sous leur costume national, ces femmes d’une nature à part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96efd30-a39e-476c-bd17-93d1f031f326",
                                                "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                                "text": "Les parties de pêche au bord de la Cuisance lui plaisaient; il admirait les coups d’épervier lancés d'une main vigoureuse par Jules Vercel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baa7647e-ec4f-46cd-bec2-10a805f73f45",
                                                "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                                "text": "Les girls passaient la tête hors de la loge en se bousculant pour admirer les duettistes qu’elles avaient entendu si flatteusement rappeler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d241814-090f-4ecb-924a-569a07286490",
                                                "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                                "text": "J’eus le plaisir d’y admirer miss Gertrude Ederle, Ailen Riggin et Helen Wainwright, qui vinrent faire une démonstration de plongeons et de nages modernes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "393cb30b-97ae-4d84-82e7-6d676a477437",
                                                "sense_id": "3a9ca583-d8d7-343a-b558-d52b3a84e4b0",
                                                "text": "Il y avait beaucoup, beaucoup de monde et tous m’admiraient parce que je suis maintenant riche à millions. Tous les millions que je possède je les ai mis dans un grand coffre, sous le tombeau de Charlemagne, à Aix-la-Chapelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dcc11be-6a74-3391-b82c-d0c796179a74",
                                        "entry_id": "a460da13-b8b6-32ea-8504-3ed4c3599108",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Considérer ce qui paraît extrême, étrange, excessif dans son genre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ironic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d02aeae0-fdf0-45c3-bcac-b214552d0a09",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcc11be-6a74-3391-b82c-d0c796179a74",
                                                "text": "Jamais je n’admirai rien de si héroïque, et David, quand il eut tué Goliath, ne dut pas avoir l’air plus enivré de triomphe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ed0cf78-6365-45a7-b8f8-fd3b6015d599",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcc11be-6a74-3391-b82c-d0c796179a74",
                                                "text": "Je vous admire de vouloir qu’on suive aveuglément vos conseils."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "260ff5a4-4c03-422b-96c8-47187d27b619",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcc11be-6a74-3391-b82c-d0c796179a74",
                                                "text": "J’admire comment on a pu prendre un semblable parti."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8fd80f1-1c25-4734-bfe3-79167167b2cb",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcc11be-6a74-3391-b82c-d0c796179a74",
                                                "text": "Vraiment, je vous admire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb6be757-3533-4897-a884-7498ac42eb28",
